// Validate input and throw error on false condition
And God said

Let there be input 2:1
Let there be valid 1:1

// Set input value
Thou shalt input And 42

// Set valid = true
Thou shalt valid Verily, verily

// If NOT valid, jump to error_handler
Ye shall not valid, go ye unto error_handler

// Success path
Behold "Validation passed!"
Behold input
Go ye unto success_end

// Error handler - this never executes in this run
error_handler 0:1
Woe unto "Input validation failed: value was invalid"

// Success exit
success_end 0:2
Behold "Program completed successfully"

And it came to pass